  "traps": [
    "src layout: setuptools finds the package semver under src (package-dir and packages.find where = [\"src\"]); no Pyright configuration, so a reader that does not add src as a root resolves no absolute import of semver",
    "the version is dynamic: setuptools reads attr semver.__about__.__version__; [tool.setuptools_scm] is configured but setuptools-scm is commented out of build-system.requires",
    "the only optional dependency, fast-semver-rs-backend, carries the marker platform_python_implementation == 'CPython'",
    "PEP 735 dependency groups: test (tox, pytest, pytest-cov) is test, typing, formatting, publish, changelog and docs are dev; devel includes six groups and gh-action includes devel plus tox-gh-actions, so the 14 names appear once each",
    "tox-gh-actions is declared without a version: declared is null, uv.lock pins 3.5.0",
    "resolved comes from uv.lock (lock version 1, four resolution markers on the Python version): one version per package",
    "docs/requirements.txt pins sphinx 7.0.1, sphinx-argparse 0.4.0 and sphinx-autodoc-typehints 1.24.0, used by the tox docs env; the docs group of pyproject.toml asks <= 8.1.3, <= 0.5.2 and == 3.0.1, and Read the Docs builds from uv export --only-group docs, not from that file",
    "tests/coerce.py and tests/semverwithvprefix.py are symlinks (mode 120000) to ../docs/advanced/coerce.py and ../docs/advanced/semverwithvprefix.py: documentation code that the test suite runs; a reader that skips docs/ and follows the links meets the files twice",
    "tox.ini asks interpreters py310 to py315 (envlist py3{10,11,12,13,14,15}, skip_missing_interpreters = True) and installs its own deps per env (pytest, pytest-cov, setuptools>=70, setuptools-scm, mypy, docformatter, ruff): tool environments, not declared dependencies",
    "[tool.black] target-version lists py37 to py311 while requires-python is >=3.10; black is not declared anywhere",
    "CI installs Python with uv python install, not setup-python: the check job pins 3.10, the tests job takes the matrix",
    "the Makefile only runs python setup.py sdist bdist_wheel --universal, and there is no setup.py"
  ]
